        <p>This site is built with Eleventy and shaped around the IndieWeb Starter Blog design, then customized with my own publishing workflow, Mastodon sharing, OG image generation, search, notes, listening, and bookshelf integrations.</p>
        <p>The visual direction leans on a dark-first palette, rounded surfaces, colorful tag treatments, and a logo system built around my current CybersecKyle mark.</p>
